{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.QuarkState.HelicityCommonSource"],"declarations":31,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.netFlavour_grading","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.netFlavour_grading","kind":"theorem","line":227,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OneSidedWeakVertex.lean#L227-L231","doc":"`[2]·J = σ + σ⁻¹` reads net flavour `−1 = 0 + (−1)`: the SUM of the flavours. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.two_smul_oneSidedR_eq_mirror","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.two_smul_oneSidedR_eq_mirror","kind":"theorem","line":210,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OneSidedWeakVertex.lean#L210-L215","doc":"`[2]·W_R = [2]·s − (q⁻¹ s − q s⁻¹)`: the mirror weighting gives the other side. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.two_smul_oneSidedL_eq_skein","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.two_smul_oneSidedL_eq_skein","kind":"theorem","line":203,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OneSidedWeakVertex.lean#L203-L208","doc":"`[2]·W_L = [2]·s − (q s − q⁻¹ s⁻¹)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.ud_letter_eq_grading","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.ud_letter_eq_grading","kind":"theorem","line":185,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OneSidedWeakVertex.lean#L185-L194","doc":"**The mixed `ud` crossing letter of the nucleon word is `([2]/2)·J`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.oneSidedL_flip","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.oneSidedL_flip","kind":"theorem","line":177,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OneSidedWeakVertex.lean#L177-L183","doc":"**The bar involution exchanges the two one-sided flips**: the L-only flip of the\nflipped letter (at `q⁻¹`) is the R-only flip of the original. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.oneSidedL_mul_oneSidedR","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.oneSidedL_mul_oneSidedR","kind":"theorem","line":171,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OneSidedWeakVertex.lean#L171-L175","doc":"The two one-sided flips are mutually inverse. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.oneSidedL_not_letter","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.oneSidedL_not_letter","kind":"theorem","line":163,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OneSidedWeakVertex.lean#L163-L169","doc":"**The L-only flip is not a letter** at any parameter, unless `q² = 1`\n(via `no_one_sided_letter`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.oneSidedR_mul_Pm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.oneSidedR_mul_Pm","kind":"theorem","line":159,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OneSidedWeakVertex.lean#L159-L161","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.oneSidedR_mul_Pp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.oneSidedR_mul_Pp","kind":"theorem","line":155,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OneSidedWeakVertex.lean#L155-L157","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.oneSidedL_mul_Pm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.oneSidedL_mul_Pm","kind":"theorem","line":151,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OneSidedWeakVertex.lean#L151-L153","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.oneSidedL_mul_Pp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.oneSidedL_mul_Pp","kind":"theorem","line":147,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OneSidedWeakVertex.lean#L147-L149","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.oneSidedR_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.oneSidedR_eq","kind":"theorem","line":140,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OneSidedWeakVertex.lean#L140-L145","doc":"**The R-only flip is `q J`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.oneSidedL_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.oneSidedL_eq","kind":"theorem","line":133,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OneSidedWeakVertex.lean#L133-L138","doc":"**The L-only flip is `q⁻¹ J`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.flip_mul_Pm_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.flip_mul_Pm_right","kind":"theorem","line":127,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OneSidedWeakVertex.lean#L127-L131","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.flip_mul_Pp_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.flip_mul_Pp_right","kind":"theorem","line":121,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OneSidedWeakVertex.lean#L121-L125","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.grading_mul_Pm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.grading_mul_Pm","kind":"theorem","line":117,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OneSidedWeakVertex.lean#L117-L119","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.grading_mul_Pp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.grading_mul_Pp","kind":"theorem","line":113,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OneSidedWeakVertex.lean#L113-L115","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.grading_flip","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.grading_flip","kind":"theorem","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OneSidedWeakVertex.lean#L109-L111","doc":"The grading is bar-invariant: the orientation flip fixes it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.two_smul_grading","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.two_smul_grading","kind":"theorem","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OneSidedWeakVertex.lean#L102-L107","doc":"`[2]·J = s + s⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.grading_comm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.grading_comm","kind":"theorem","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OneSidedWeakVertex.lean#L99-L100","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.grading_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.grading_sq","kind":"theorem","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OneSidedWeakVertex.lean#L93-L97","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.eq_of_eigen_action","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.eq_of_eigen_action","kind":"theorem","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OneSidedWeakVertex.lean#L86-L91","doc":"**Uniqueness.** An element is determined by its action on the two eigenlines. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.Pm_eigen_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.Pm_eigen_right","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OneSidedWeakVertex.lean#L83-L84","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex.